This project is an independent, community-driven Rust reimplementation of the
BPMN / CMMN / DMN / Event Registry engines and REST API of the Flowable
workflow project.

It is NOT affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by Flowable AG.
"Flowable" is a trademark of Flowable AG.

---

This product includes material derived from Flowable
(https://github.com/flowable/flowable-engine), licensed under the
Apache License, Version 2.0:

- Process / case / decision XML test fixtures under
  `modules/flowable-bpmn-converter/tests/resources/java_fixtures/`
  are copied from the Flowable test suite.
- Ground-truth JSON files under
  `modules/flowable-bpmn-converter/tests/resources/ground_truth/`
  are derived from the output of the Flowable BPMN converter.
- Large parts of the engine logic were ported by closely following the
  Flowable Java source code; source comments cite the corresponding
  Java files and line numbers.

